    \item Clear and concise feedback should be provided to the user after each action.
\end{itemize}

\subsubsection{Security Requirements}
\label{sec:specific:nonfunctional:security}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Basic security measures should be implemented to prevent unauthorized access to data. \textit{[Specific measures to be defined based on technology choices.]}
